center px-4\">\n        <h1 class=\"font-fredoka text-white text-5xl sm:text-6xl mb-2\" style=\"animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out both\">Fresh, Fast, Friendly</h1>\n        <p class=\"font-nunito text-lg text-white sm:text-xl mb-6 opacity-70\">Modern laundromat in Brooklyn. Self-service washers and dryers, drop-off service, and free WiFi.</p>\n        <nav>\n            <ul class=\"flex gap-4\">\n                <li><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white hover:text-accent transition-colors duration-200\">Home</a></li>\n            </ul>\n        </nav>\n    </div>\n</header>\n\n<style>\n@keyframes fadeInUp {\n    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }\n    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n.glass-card {\n    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: -5px -5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 5px 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n    transition: all 300ms ease;\n}\n.glass-card:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.05);\n    box-shadow: -7px -7px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), 7px 7px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n}\n</style>\n\n<section id=\"services\" class=\"bg-[#f9fafb] py-24\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-center text-3xl font-bold mb-8\">Our Services</h2>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 items-center justify-center\">\n      <!-- Service Item 1 -->\n      <article class=\"glass-card p-4 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300\">\n        <i class=\"icon-wash text-5xl mb-4\"></i>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Self-service wash & dry</h3>\n        <p>Enjoy clean clothes without the hassle of waiting in line.</p>\n      </article>\n      \n      <!-- Service Item 2 -->\n      <article class=\"glass-card p-4 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300\">\n        <i class=\"icon-drop-off text-5xl mb-4\"></i>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Drop-off laundry service</h3>\n        <p>Simply drop off your clothes and we'll take care of the rest.</p>\n      </article>\n      \n      <!-- Service Item 3 -->\n      <article class=\"glass-card p-4 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300\">\n        <i class=\"icon-dry-cleaning text-5xl mb-4\"></i>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Dry cleaning</h3>\n        <p>Get your delicate items spotlessly clean and crisp.</p>\n      </article>\n      \n      <!-- Service Item 4 -->\n      <article class=\"glass-card p-4 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300\">\n        <i class=\"icon-fluff-fold text-5xl mb-4\"></i>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Fluff & fold</h3>\n        <p>Receive your laundry neatly folded and ready for wear.</p>\n      </article>\n      \n      <!-- Service Item 5 -->\n      <article class=\"glass-card p-4 rounded-lg shadow-md hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300\">\n        <i class=\"icon-wifi text-5xl mb-4\"></i>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Free WiFi</h3>\n        <p>Stay connected with high-speed internet during your visit.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"bg-gray-200 py-24\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 text-center\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8\" style=\"animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out both;\">Hours of Operation</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-lg mb-12\">Open 7am-11pm daily</p>\n    <div class=\"glass-card p-6 rounded-lg shadow-xl\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-4\">Get Started Today!</h3>\n      <button role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Book Now\" class=\"bg-primary text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300\">Book Now</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  .glass-card {\n    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    box-shadow: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3) 0px 4px 8px -2px, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2) 0px 1px 2px 0px;\n    transition: all 0.15s ease-in-out;\n  }\n\n  .glass-card:hover {\n    transform: translateY(-2px);\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section id=\"about-us\" class=\"bg-[#F9FAFB] py-24\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 text-center\">\n    <h1 style=\"animation: fadeInUp 0.8s ease-out both\" class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-[var(--color-primary)] bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--color-accent)] to-[var(--color-secondary)] -webkit-background-clip:text -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent\">Welcome to Bubble Up Laundromat</h1>\n    <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-700 mb-8\">We are a modern laundromat in Brooklyn offering self-service washers and dryers, drop-off laundry service, and free WiFi. Our friendly staff is always ready to help with any questions or concerns.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"contact\" class=\"bg-[#f9fafb] py-24\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12\">Get in Touch</h2>\n    <form action=\"#\" method=\"post\" class=\"max-w-lg mx-auto\">\n      <div class=\"mb-4\">\n        <label for=\"name\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Name</label>\n        <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required class=\"mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 sm:text-sm\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mb-4\">\n        <label for=\"email\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Email</label>\n        <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" required class=\"mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 sm:text-sm\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"mb-4\">\n        <label for=\"message\" class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700\">Message</label>\n        <textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" required rows=\"6\" class=\"mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 sm:text-sm\"></textarea>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"submit\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Send Message\" class=\"inline-flex justify-center py-2 px-4 border border-transparent text-sm font-medium rounded-md shadow-sm text-white bg-[#EA580C] hover:bg-[#e74c3c] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 transition-all duration-300 transform-gpu scale-100 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-xl\">Send Message</button>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"location\" class=\"bg-[#f9fafc] py-24\">\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-center text-3xl font-bold text-secondary mb-8\">Find Us</h2>\n    <article class=\"glass-card p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md max-w-lg mx-auto text-center\">\n      <header>\n        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-primary mb-4\">Our Location</h3>\n      </header>\n      <p class=\"mb-4\">1234 Brooklyn Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11205</p>\n      <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir//Bubble+Up+Laundromat/@40.698784,-73.9848766,17z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x89c25c1f8e45a0d7:0x1b486a1cc29fc33c!8m2!3d40.6987813!4d-73.9826879!16s%2Fg%2F1z8qf5yv?entry=ttu\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn bg-primary text-secondary px-4 py-2 rounded-full shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-xl inline-block mt-4\">Get Directions</a>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n  <section id=\"faq\" class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16\">\n    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-8\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n    <details class=\"border-b border-gray-200 py-4\">\n      <summary class=\"cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg text-gray-800\">What services does Bubble Up Laundromat offer?</summary>\n      <p class=\"faq-answer mt-2 text-gray-600\">Bubble Up Laundromat offers self-service wash & dry, drop-off laundry service, dry cleaning, fluff & fold, and free WiFi.</p>\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"border-b border-gray-200 py-4\">\n      <summary class=\"cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg text-gray-800\">When is Bubble Up Laundromat open?</summary>\n      <p class=\"faq-answer mt-2 text-gray-600\">Bubble Up Laundromat is open from 7am to 11pm daily.</p>\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"border-b border-gray-200 py-4\">\n      <summary class=\"cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg text-gray-800\">Is there a charge for using the laundromat?</summary>\n      <p class=\"faq-answer mt-2 text-gray-600\">No, there are no charges for using the self-service washers and dryers. However, some additional services like dry cleaning may incur fees.</p>\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"border-b border-gray-200 py-4\">\n      <summary class=\"cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg text-gray-800\">Do they offer free WiFi?</summary>\n      <p class=\"faq-answer mt-2 text-gray-600\">Yes, Bubble Up Laundromat provides free WiFi to its customers.</p>\n    </details>\n    <details class=\"border-b border-gray-200 py-4\">\n      <summary class=\"cursor-pointer font-semibold text-lg text-gray-800\">What is the location of Bubble Up Laundromat?</summary>\n      <p class=\"faq-answer mt-2 text-gray-600\">Bubble Up Laundromat is located in Brooklyn.</p>\n    </details>\n  </section>\n</body>\n</html>",
